# Build context filter for `edge/Dockerfile` (context: the repository root).
#
# The build context is the repository root, and the H5 build output lives under
# `apps/uni-app/`. BuildKit prefers this per-Dockerfile file over the root
# `.dockerignore`, so the edge build gets its own view of the context: the edge
# config and the H5 build, nothing else.
#
# Everything is excluded, then the two things the edge needs are allowed back.

*
!docker/edge
!apps/uni-app/dist

# Never, whatever the rules above say.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
